## Secrets — never commit real connection strings / tokens / keys
# The live appsettings.json holds the DB password and JWT key.
# Set these on the server via environment variables or a local copy of the file.
# The deploy/appsettings.template.json (no real secrets) IS tracked.
appsettings.json
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Local.json
secrets.json

